.TH "INSPEKT\-CONTROL" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-control \- Control the browser remotely from your terminal.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]control\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Control the browser remotely from your terminal.
.PP
All keyboard input from your terminal will be sent directly to the
browser, allowing you to navigate, type, and interact with the page
remotely.
.PP
Supports:
.IP \(bu 2
Regular text input
.IP \(bu 2
Special keys (arrows, Enter, Tab, Escape, etc.)
.IP \(bu 2
Modifier keys (Ctrl, Alt, Shift, Cmd)
.PP
Press Ctrl+D to exit control mode.
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt control
.EE
